Changes from 1.2.0 to 1.2.1 (2026-11-09)

- Removed: The demo site's map page rule for object 164 ([location_gmaps_include] in settings/override.ini.append.php).
  Object 164 is an unrelated page on any other site, and location_gmaps.tpl is only in the admin design, so the rule
  logged "path 'location_gmaps.tpl' not found" on every front page. The rule stays in the file as a commented example:
  to show a map page through location_gmaps.tpl, copy it into your own siteaccess override.ini with your page's
  object id.

Upgrading: composer update and clear the caches. A site that relied on the rule for its own object 164 adds it to its
siteaccess override.ini.
